<div class=3D"WordSection1">
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">Good afternoon.&nbsp; I am Jonathan Shapiera, a clien=
t of the NDIS.&nbsp; I would like to discuss some statements related proced=
ures of the NDIS.&nbsp; Over the past few weeks, we, the clientele,
 and Lived Experience of Forward Focused Group (FFG), who is my Service Pro=
vider, have been severely impacted and traumatised by the actions of one As=
sistant Director in a branch of the NDIS.&nbsp; A copy of the email below e=
xplains my communication to them on behalf
 of the Lived Experience.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">The facts of the matter are thus:<o:p></o:p></span></=
p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; An orga=
nisation by the name of Nurse Assist 24/7=92s CEO verbally attacked my care=
r in a car park in Rockingham in my presence a few weeks ago.<o:p></o:p></s=
pan></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; A VRO w=
as issued against this CEO Amanda Damon, which stands today.<o:p></o:p></sp=
an></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-36.0pt"><sp=
an style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Abadi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Three of four of my carers had pr=
eviously worked for Nurse Assist 24/7 and have serious issues with the atti=
tude, behaviour
 and competence of this CEO and Company.&nbsp; Hence the reason they left.<=
o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-36.0pt"><sp=
an style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Abadi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Mr. Nathan Halls, an Assistant Di=
rector of NDIA began emailing Forward Focused Group clients with unfounded =
allegations
 of fraud and corruption and explaining they had to move house.<o:p></o:p><=
/span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; I was c=
ontacted by NDIA=92s Nathan Halls and told that FFG were fraudulent and cor=
rupt.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; I asked=
 about facts and evidence and Mr. Halls stated he has been investigating fo=
r over 4 months.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; At this=
 stage, no evidence has been produced, no factual matters were produced, an=
d everything from NDIA was run on the smell of an oily rag.
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; No fact=
s or evidence of fraud or corruption against FFG &amp; The Hive have been s=
ubstantiated or have been produced.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; I am to=
 understand that several of FFG &amp; The Hive clients were told that to pr=
oceed with the relocation, My Halls would increase their funding.<o:p></o:p=
></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; My fund=
ing has been increased by $200,000 over two years just to move house.&nbsp;=
 Please see the email below.
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Mr Hall=
s further stated that I was to relocate to another service provider of his =
choice to accommodation of another company that I am unsure of.<o:p></o:p><=
/span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Mr. Hal=
ls advised that I was to be contacted by Ms. Sukhi Tear, CEO of Diversatas,=
 who would be my Service Provider.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; He furt=
her stated that I would receive an upgrade to my plan =93if I played=94 alo=
ng with these proceedings.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal" style=3D"margin-left:36.0pt;text-indent:-36.0pt"><sp=
an style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Abadi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&=
nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Mr. Halls told Assist Plan Manage=
rs that payments to FFG was no longer allowed.&nbsp; Reimbursement of funds=
 from invoices
 presented by FFG to the Plan &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Manager was stopped.<o:p></=
o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; FFG wit=
hout funding, had all staff made redundant.&nbsp; The Hive continued to tra=
de.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Ms. Bar=
bara Lundgren, Nathan Halls manager, reinstated funding and the paying of i=
nvoices to FFG.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; FFG con=
tinues to trade and most of staff have returned.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; NDIA As=
sistant Director Nathan Halls continues to unsettle FFG and transfer client=
s from FFG control to another source via Diversatas.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Diversa=
tas do NOT disclose that they act on behalf of the Federal Government<o:p><=
/o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4 clien=
ts were lost via this method this week.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">The emotional statements are as follows:<o:p></o:p></=
span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The Liv=
ed Experience are very pissed off that we, can be uprooted and distributed =
to places of uncertainty at a moment=92s notice without factual evidence.<o=
:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The tra=
uma that has been incurred by all parties directly and indirectly is a matt=
er of disturbance that needs addressing.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The rel=
ationship =93as friends=94 between Mr. Halls and several of these other NDI=
S registered organisations runs deep.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Many em=
ployees of these other organisations have compiled hateful and vindictive s=
lants at FFG employees.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The CEO=
 of Forward Focused Group, Mrs Vida Reid, has received death threats from a=
n anonymous party through social media.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; The sta=
ff of FFG are in the midst of creating a petition that requests the NDIA to=
 look at this matter and bring it to a stop.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; NDIA is=
 currently refusing to interfere.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; As of 1=
4th October the email below has not been responded to, hence the reason for=
 seeking media support.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; Mr Hall=
s has on several occasions disclosed confidential information and continues=
 to do so without consequence.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">=95&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; My son =
and I have suffered greatly over the years to the extent of being homeless =
for nearly 3 years living in our car.&nbsp; In 2014 I wrote a document to t=
he Federal Senate
 commenting on homelessness.&nbsp; I was hoisted into the position of advoc=
ate and from there have worked towards helping others where necessary.&nbsp=
; Forward Focus became the family for us that we have not had.&nbsp; The at=
tempted dismantling of FFG by those who seem jealous
 of the position of its creator, is a shambles.&nbsp; It is disrupting and =
tearing down the bonds that are created to form the NDIS.&nbsp; The necessi=
ty of the NDIS stands firm for those who are and have a disability.&nbsp; M=
y son, at age 27 is going blind and is still waiting
 for NDIS approval.&nbsp; This approval was promised by Nathan Halls in the=
 consideration that I co-operate.&nbsp; Words to that affect were stated du=
ring conversation.&nbsp; For the sake of my son it would have been thought =
that I would shut up and not make mention of this
 matter.&nbsp; Nikolaus and I discussed this at length and decided that eve=
n in the event that he does not get the attention he deserves due to his de=
grading eye condition, it is far better to speak for those who have little =
or no voice at all, the Lived Experience.&nbsp;
 This matter has come to the stage that it is impacting staff, clients and =
other family members from an indirect purpose.&nbsp; Those that are still i=
nvolved with FFG remain loyal to the creators Simon &amp; Vida Reid.&nbsp; =
Mrs Reid has received award recently for Businesswomen
 of the Year. Her accomplishments are to be acknowledged, not disputed and =
certainly not to be made a mockery of.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">The article below is to be released 15th October and =
quite frankly I haven=92t seen more bullshit by NDIA than frogs on a lily p=
ad.&nbsp; They have continued to dismantle FFG at their
 own discretion but remain incognito when the media arrive.&nbsp; No explan=
ation has been offered.&nbsp; The Lived Experience are suffering consequent=
ially because of the unprofessionalism of the WA branch of the NDIA.&nbsp; =
We, as those with a disability will go all out
 to fight&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><img width=3D"462" height=3D"165" style=3D"width:4.8=
125in;height:1.7187in" id=3D"Picture_x0020_1" src=3D"cid:image001.png@01D8E=
03B.58873D60"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Abadi&quot;=
,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp=
;&nbsp;
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++=
++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">Good day to you Miss Lundgren,<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">I am Jonathan Shapiera, and I am one of Forward Focus=
ed Group clients.&nbsp; I am extremely pleased to hear the news that FFG an=
d The Hive are now able to operate again and trade.&nbsp;
 As a representative and advocate of the FFG clients, I can say clearly tha=
t it has been a week of pure uncertainty.&nbsp; It is not necessary for any=
 disability client to state the trauma that they, as a person have gone thr=
ough prior to these circumstances taking
 fold. Companies like FFG &amp; The Hive work towards alleviating such trau=
ma that is, in many cases, suffered daily.&nbsp; This particular trauma tha=
t we have suffered in the face of being relocated to houses and operations =
that we are unfamiliar with, is a disaster
 on its own. This is majorly due to your staff member Nathan Miles who seem=
s to have taken it upon himself to run an operation that can only be descri=
bed as an abuse of power.&nbsp; I believe the necessity for investigations =
into that power that your staff has,
 needs clarifying.&nbsp; This is an Assistant Manager gone wrong.&nbsp; Mr =
Miles divulged to me that investigations of fraud and misrepresentation of =
funds against FFG and The Hive was the reason for my particular relocation.=
&nbsp; As a Federal Officer, I question his abilities
 to carry on.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">After viewing the recent media coverage about the NDI=
S, I certainly concur with the necessity, as Dylan Alcot stated, that Lived=
 Experience must play an important factor in ensuring
 that your operations are well and truly kept above board and done legally.=
&nbsp; I make mention of the fact that my own NDIS plan has increased by so=
me $100,000 per year for the simplicity of moving house.&nbsp; Ms Lundgren,=
 this is Government monies that your staff
 member has distributed me to move operations from my existing provider hom=
e to one supplied by an appointed Mr Miles Co-ordinator, Miss Suhki Tear. H=
ow the hell do I spend $100,000 of Government money moving house?&nbsp; Or =
is this considered as SHUT UP MONEY?&nbsp;
 In all consideration of this money, I do believe this should be distribute=
d to ALL FFG clients for the trauma and inconsideration your staff member h=
as caused.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">I am an educated person who has worked in corporate f=
or many years before retirement.&nbsp; I ask for you to consider the client=
s during this disturbance that were not able to make
 a determination on their own faculties.&nbsp; They were told that the oper=
ations of FFG and The Hive were wrong, false, and illegal.&nbsp; I do have =
this on good note and only if necessary, would invoke legal proceeding on b=
ehalf of Lived Experience.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">I would like to also make mention of my son, Nikolaus=
.&nbsp; We have been trying for well over eighteen months to get a written =
letter to support my sons sight problem.&nbsp; We submitted
 a NDIS application a few months ago based upon Nikolaus severe depression =
and anxiety which has been rejected.&nbsp; Last week we were finally able t=
o receive a report by an optometrist who says that my son is legally blind =
with severely reduced sight at present.&nbsp;
 Your Mr Miles gave consideration to look at this report, which was forward=
ed to him via Ms. Suhki Tear.&nbsp; I was of the opinion, and I apologise t=
hat I cannot state clearly due to my ever-present brain fog, that my son=92=
s application was to be approved.&nbsp; Given
 the fact that he and his friend have been given an exit notice from a Yara=
n Properties Supported Independent Living unit in Rockingham, he has less t=
han 2 weeks to find somewhere else to live.&nbsp; As my son and I spent in =
the vicinity of nearly 3 years homeless
 living in my car, I would sincerely hope that this episode is not repeated=
 for a nearly blind young man.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif">Before going to the media to report the inconsistenci=
es with your organisation, I would like to hear your response.&nbsp; I woul=
d like to ask that you do not furnish me with bullshit
 articles from the NDIS.&nbsp; I am not in the mood to go chasing through a=
rticles to examine who said what.&nbsp; Kindly pertain your response to a p=
erson who has suffered severely over the years to be considered an honest N=
DIS client looking for a favourable outcome
 that satisfies all concerned.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Ab=
adi&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;AR=
 JULIAN&quot;;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU">Regards<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-size:20.0pt;font-family:&quot;Br=
ush Script MT&quot;;color:#0070C0;mso-fareast-language:EN-AU">Jonathan Shap=
iera<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span style=3D"font-family:&quot;AR JULIAN&quot;;col=
